  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "うちゅう　から　しんぴの　ちからを\nとりこむ　ことで　じぶんの\nぼうぎょと　とくぼうを　あげる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "우주로부터 신비한 힘을\n손에 넣음으로써\n자신의 방어와 특수방어를 올린다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "吸取來自宇宙的神秘力量，\n提高自己的防禦和特防。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Le lanceur absorbe un pouvoir mystique spatial\nqui augmente sa Défense et sa Défense Spéciale.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Erhöht Verteidigung und Spezial-Verteidigung durch\neine mystische Kraft.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Sube la Defensa y la Defensa Especial propias con\nenergía mística.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Chi la usa assorbe una forza mistica dallo spazio\nche aumenta la Difesa e la Difesa Speciale.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The user absorbs a mystical power from space to\nraise its Defense and Sp. Def stats.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "宇宙から　神秘の　力を\nとりこむ　ことで\n自分の　防御と　特防を　あげる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
